{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22848","headline":"春末夏初闲游江郭二首 一 · 白居易","name":"春末夏初闲游江郭二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲出乘轻屐，徐行蹋輭沙。\n观鱼傍湓浦，看竹入杨家。\n林迸穿篱笋，藤飘落水花。\n雨埋钓舟小，风扬酒旗斜。\n嫩剥青菱角，浓煎白茗芽。\n淹留不知夕，城树欲栖鸦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22848.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22848","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}